@startuml editor-shell-sequence
title Open project -> browse -> edit -> save

actor User
participant "IdeApp (ide-ui)" as UI
participant "Project (ide-core)" as Project
participant "Buffer (ide-core)" as Buffer
participant "Filesystem" as FS

User -> UI: click "Open Project"
UI -> UI: rfd::FileDialog::pick_folder()
UI -> Project: Project::open(dir)
Project -> FS: canonicalize + validate directory
FS --> Project: ok
Project --> UI: Project

UI -> Project: scan_tree()
Project -> FS: walk entries\n(skip symlink-escapes, unreadable)
FS --> Project: entries
Project --> UI: DirEntry tree
UI -> UI: render tree in left panel

User -> UI: click file in tree
UI -> Buffer: Buffer::open(path)
Buffer -> FS: read_to_string(path)
FS --> Buffer: contents
Buffer --> UI: Buffer
UI -> UI: open new tab, focus it

User -> UI: types in editor
UI -> Buffer: insert(offset, text)
Buffer -> Buffer: push Edit onto undo_stack,\nmark dirty

User -> UI: Cmd/Ctrl+S
UI -> Buffer: save()
Buffer -> FS: write(path, text)
FS --> Buffer: ok
Buffer -> Buffer: dirty = false
Buffer --> UI: Ok(())
UI -> UI: clear dirty indicator on tab

@enduml
